msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我站在床边，⟪k:1⟫静静地低头看着她。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9BD8D0C9_A667_42CB_BBA6_176213ECF1A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
