msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the locked-away despair and wails of lamentation I thought myself no longer capable of came "
"bubbling back to the surface."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫接着，⟪k:1⟫内心隐藏的绝望感、⟪k:2⟫原以为再不会发出的哀叹，⟪k:3⟫慢慢地涌上心头。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DFD9106B_4AC6_4564_AB5F_2270AE250704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89ede2eb5ff439da78ce0b636a5ffed09e11eeb91aecd45ea75055f7a5faf329
